              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Uum 22.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abbaani Solomoni, hayyu Daudini, duru qara fulla Mana Waaqa iti jaarani kurfeese. Fullaani sunini dira Yerusalemu gaara Moria gubba, jirti. Isiini duri oobdi, Arauna, ka gosa Yebusi. Solomonini huji ijaarsa suni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jia lameeso ganna afreeso ka hayyuma isaa iti keeyate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Solomonini AABBO Waaqaa jaaru d'eerinni isaa d'und'uma jaatama, ballinni d'und'uma sodoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle Mana suni fuula isa dura mana d'ibi iraa jaarani, ka ballinni isaa d'und'uma diddama, old'eerinni isaa d'und'uma d'ibbafi diddama. Mana suni keesa fulla ch'ufa worqiini ch'okhani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana gudda kaani bada isaa garaa keesa mukha hind'eesa naqani worqiini ch'okhani, worqi sunile waan aka meet'itifi lootitini barreesani ch'okhani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyichi Mana suni ch'ufa d'akhaaye mimid'aadu ch'uch'ulut'ufi worqi lafa Parvaimu d'ufaniini ch'okhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni girgida mana suni ch'ufa worqiini ch'okhe, dareerafi Mikhikilafi balbalale ch'ufa akasuma worqiini ch'okhe, girgidale gubbati hogeeyini akheekha waan lubbu qaba ka koola mid'aasite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.26.33+EXO.26.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bah 26.33-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Dinqa ka Fulla Fulla Ch'ufa Ira Qulqullo jed'ani, d'eerinni isaa d'und'uma diddama, ballinnileeni diddama, ballinni isaa haguma ballinna Mana gudda kaani. Worqiini girgida dinqa sunitini ch'okhani, ulfinni isii kilo kuma diddamati; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ammalle musubaara worqiini mid'aasanile ulfinni isaa diqo nusa kilo ira jira. Girgida mana gubbale worqiini ch'okhani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
