              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Fulla Fulla Ch'ufa Ira Qulqullo keesa hayyichi akheekha waan lubbu qaba ka koola lama sibiilani mid'aase, worqiini ch'okhe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fuula balbalati deebise moga moga d'ad'abe. Wonti suni lachu koola lama qabdi, koola ch'ufa d'eerinni isaa d'und'uma shani; koola suni ballisani mid'aasani, aka inni wod'aka mana suni keesati wolituqe mana suni girgida gama gamaleti eju, akanaani kooli suni ballinna mana suni ka d'und'uma diddama guuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.11+2CH.3.12+2CH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.11",
              "2CH.3.12",
              "2CH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.26.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bah 26.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Golla woya booftatifi woya d'ibiini mid'aasani, waan bulefi bule diimtufi diimtuni barreesani, ammalle akheekha waan lubbu qaba ka koolatiini ch'okhani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sibiila didiima lama ka aka utuba old'ad'aabani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyichi sibiila didiima lama, ka aka utuba old'ad'aabani tume mid'aase, ka kamu d'und'uma sodomi shani. Duuba fuud'e, balbala Mana Waaqa dura d'ad'abe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mata utuba suni lachu, waan aka lootitifi waan aka okhoku, ka sibiila diima iraa mid'aasani ka d'ibba tokotini barreesani ch'okhani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utuba suni balbala Mana Waaqa dura moga moga d'ad'aabani: ka bita aanuni Yakini jed'ani, ka mirga aanuni Boazi jed'ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miha Mana Waaqaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
